# Normalize line endings to LF in the working tree on every platform,
# including a Windows checkout where Git's core.autocrlf would otherwise
# convert LF to CRLF. Without this, every text file's on-disk bytes differ
# from what packages/provenance.json records, and check-provenance.py fails
# unconditionally on Windows (observed: windows-latest CI, 2026-09-23).
* text=auto eol=lf
